					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Greetings!  Welcome to Elite Mystic Force!  I want to thank all of you who have joined recently and all of those that are loyal to the guild.  I will be revising a set of guidelines that should be respected, as in all guilds.  Please feel free to post places you would like to go, or items (within reason) that you would like to retrieve.  As a guild, we will assist you as much as we can.  Thank you again, and see you all online!!<br />
<br />
Gen
